### billing-platform API tests
### Use the VS Code "REST Client" extension to run these.
### Install: ext install humao.rest-client
### Set @token from the login response's accessToken field.
### Set @refreshToken from the login response's refreshToken field
### (needed for the /auth/refresh and /auth/logout requests below).

@base = http://localhost:3000
@token = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE_AFTER_LOGIN
@refreshToken = PASTE_REFRESH_TOKEN_HERE_AFTER_LOGIN

# =============================================================================
# AUTH
# =============================================================================

### Register a new business
POST {{base}}/api/tenants/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "businessName": "Test Kirana Store",
  "ownerName": "Test Owner",
  "phone": "9000000001",
  "pin": "1234",
  "domainType": "retail",
  "stateCode": "24"
}

###

### Login (use seed data: phone 9876543210, pin 1111)
### Response now includes BOTH accessToken (15min) and refreshToken (30d).
### Copy both into the @token / @refreshToken variables above.
# @name login
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "9876543210",
  "pin": "1111"
}

###

### Refresh — exchange the refresh token for a new access token + new refresh token.
### Note: the OLD refreshToken is invalidated the instant this runs (rotation).
### Update @refreshToken with the NEW value from the response before running again.
POST {{base}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

###

### Logout — revokes the refresh token server-side
POST {{base}}/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

###

### Logout from all devices (requires valid access token)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/logout-all-devices
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Health check (no auth)
GET {{base}}/health

# =============================================================================
# PRODUCTS
# =============================================================================

### List all products
GET {{base}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Search products by name (fuzzy)
GET {{base}}/api/products?q=amul
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Barcode scan
GET {{base}}/api/products/barcode/8901030000001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Low stock alerts
GET {{base}}/api/products/low-stock
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Create a product
POST {{base}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Parle-G Biscuit 100g",
  "nameLocal": "पारले-जी बिस्किट",
  "barcode": "8901719110019",
  "hsnSacCode": "19053100",
  "gstRate": 18,
  "unit": "pcs",
  "purchasePrice": 8,
  "salePrice": 10,
  "mrp": 10,
  "trackStock": true,
  "lowStockQty": 10,
  "domainAttrs": {
    "brand": "Parle",
    "pack_size": "100g",
    "reorder_qty": 50
  },
  "openingStock": 100,
  "openingRate": 8
}

###

### Suggest HSN code for a product
POST {{base}}/api/products/REPLACE_WITH_PRODUCT_ID/suggest-hsn
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Confirm HSN suggestion
POST {{base}}/api/products/REPLACE_WITH_PRODUCT_ID/confirm-hsn
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hsnCode": "19053100",
  "gstRate": 18
}

###

### Manual stock adjustment
POST {{base}}/api/products/REPLACE_WITH_PRODUCT_ID/stock-adjustment
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "qty": -5,
  "reason": "Damaged goods",
  "notes": "Water damage in storage"
}

# =============================================================================
# PARTIES
# =============================================================================

### List customers
GET {{base}}/api/parties?type=customer
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Udhaar list (customers with outstanding balance)
GET {{base}}/api/parties?type=customer&hasDebt=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Udhaar summary
GET {{base}}/api/parties/udhaar/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Create a customer
POST {{base}}/api/parties
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "customer",
  "name": "Suresh Kumar",
  "phone": "9712345679",
  "address": {
    "city": "Vadodara",
    "state": "Gujarat",
    "stateCode": "24"
  },
  "creditLimit": 2000
}

###

### Party statement (ledger)
GET {{base}}/api/parties/REPLACE_WITH_PARTY_ID/statement
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

# =============================================================================
# INVOICES
# =============================================================================

### Create a sale invoice
POST {{base}}/api/invoices
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "txnType": "sale_invoice",
  "partyId": "REPLACE_WITH_PARTY_ID",
  "items": [
    {
      "description": "Amul Butter 100g",
      "qty": 2,
      "rate": 55,
      "discountPct": 0,
      "gstRate": 12,
      "unit": "pcs"
    },
    {
      "description": "Tata Salt 1kg",
      "qty": 1,
      "rate": 22,
      "discountPct": 0,
      "gstRate": 0,
      "unit": "pcs"
    }
  ],
  "domainData": {
    "is_udhaar": false,
    "source": "pos"
  }
}

###

### Idempotency test — run this exact request TWICE with the same key.
### First run creates the invoice. Second run returns the SAME invoice
### (check the X-Idempotent-Replay: true response header) instead of
### creating a duplicate. Change the key value to test a fresh request.
POST {{base}}/api/invoices
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: test-key-001

{
  "txnType": "sale_invoice",
  "items": [
    { "description": "Idempotency test item", "qty": 1, "rate": 100, "gstRate": 18 }
  ]
}

###

### Cash / walk-in sale (no partyId)
POST {{base}}/api/invoices
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "txnType": "sale_invoice",
  "items": [
    {
      "description": "Parle-G Biscuit 100g",
      "qty": 3,
      "rate": 10,
      "gstRate": 18
    }
  ]
}

###

### List invoices (today's sales)
GET {{base}}/api/invoices?txnType=sale_invoice&status=confirmed
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Daily summary (Z-report)
GET {{base}}/api/invoices/summary/daily
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Get invoice detail
GET {{base}}/api/invoices/REPLACE_WITH_INVOICE_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Record payment against invoice
POST {{base}}/api/invoices/REPLACE_WITH_INVOICE_ID/payment
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 100,
  "method": "upi",
  "refNo": "UPI-20250614-123456"
}

###

### Generate a Razorpay payment link for outstanding balance
### Requires RAZORPAY_KEY_ID / RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET set in .env (test mode keys are fine)
POST {{base}}/api/invoices/REPLACE_WITH_INVOICE_ID/payment-link
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Cancel an invoice
POST {{base}}/api/invoices/REPLACE_WITH_INVOICE_ID/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

# =============================================================================
# STOCK
# =============================================================================

### Current stock levels for all products
GET {{base}}/api/stock
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
